### Posting (Flow 4): sign an upload, PUT the file, create the post, read it back. Needs a signed-in user.
### Get a token by signing in (see auth.http) and paste its accessToken here:
@token = <paste accessToken>
@nicheId = <paste the id of a niche you have joined>
@otherNicheId = <paste the id of a niche you have NOT joined>
@mediaId = <paste mediaId from the sign response>
@uploadUrl = <paste uploadUrl from the sign response>
@postId = <paste id from the create response>

### 1. Sign an upload -> { uploadUrl, mediaId }. The URL works for 15 minutes. 30 per hour per user.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/uploads/sign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "contentType": "image/png", "bytes": 48213 }

### 400 UNSUPPORTED_MEDIA_TYPE: not an allowed type
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/uploads/sign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "contentType": "application/pdf", "bytes": 48213 }

### 413 MEDIA_TOO_LARGE: over the image cap (20 MB by default)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/uploads/sign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "contentType": "image/jpeg", "bytes": 52428800 }

### 400 VALIDATION_FAILED: bytes missing
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/uploads/sign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "contentType": "image/png" }

### 2. PUT the file to storage. Point the line below at a real file whose size is the signed "bytes"; Content-Type must match too.
PUT {{uploadUrl}}
Content-Type: image/png

< C:/path/to/your/image.png

### 3. Create the post -> 201, status "processing". 20 per hour per user.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mediaId": "{{mediaId}}",
  "caption": "spent 3 hours making a pivot table do one thing. worth it.",
  "nicheId": "{{nicheId}}",
  "audience": "everyone",
  "allowComments": true,
  "taggedUserIds": []
}

### 409 MEDIA_ALREADY_USED: run the create again with the same mediaId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mediaId": "{{mediaId}}", "nicheId": "{{nicheId}}" }

### 403 NOT_A_NICHE_MEMBER: sign a fresh upload first, then post it to a niche you have not joined
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mediaId": "{{mediaId}}", "nicheId": "{{otherNicheId}}" }

### 404 MEDIA_NOT_FOUND: unknown media, or someone else's
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mediaId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "nicheId": "{{nicheId}}" }

### 400 TAGGED_USER_NOT_FOUND: a tagged user who does not exist (or blocks you, or you block)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mediaId": "{{mediaId}}", "nicheId": "{{nicheId}}", "taggedUserIds": ["00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"] }

### 400 MEDIA_TYPE_MISMATCH: sign as video/mp4, PUT a PNG, then create the post
### 409 MEDIA_NOT_UPLOADED: sign, skip the PUT, then create the post

### 400 VALIDATION_FAILED: audience must be everyone or niche_members
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mediaId": "{{mediaId}}", "nicheId": "{{nicheId}}", "audience": "friends" }

### 4. Read the post. The author sees it while processing; others only once published.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 404 POST_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 401 without a token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts/{{postId}}
